{"id":200,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"理数探究を極める都立富士附属中","feature_description":"都立富士高等学校・附属中学校は、教養主義を基盤に、挑戦力・理数的発見力・理数的解決力を育てる6年間の中高一貫校です。課題研究『富士未来学』を中核に据え、科学探究部や各種運動部・文化部が活発に活動しており、理数探究と学校生活がつながっています。 部活動の詳細ページでは活動内容や目標が具体的で、理数探究を日々の活動へ落とし込む姿勢が確認できます。","clubs":[{"id":3519,"name":"合唱部（中学）（高校）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/fuji-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3520,"name":"科学探究部生物班（中学）（高校）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/fuji-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3521,"name":"科学探究部化学班（中学）（高校）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/fuji-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3522,"name":"科学探究部物理班（中学）（高校）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/fuji-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3523,"name":"演劇部（中学）（高校）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/fuji-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3524,"name":"軟式野球部（中学）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/fuji-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3525,"name":"女子バスケットボール部（中学）（高校）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/fuji-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3526,"name":"女子バレーボール部（中学）（高校）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/fuji-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3527,"name":"バドミントン（中学）（高校）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/fuji-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3528,"name":"剣道部（中学）（高校）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/fuji-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3529,"name":"薙刀部（中学）（高校）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/fuji-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-0